<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1824708584"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1551613743"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Till I"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="SawanoHiroyuki[nZk] / 優里"/><amll:meta key="album" value="iv"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="02:52.821"><div begin="00:51.447" end="04:08.731"><p begin="00:51.447" end="01:02.029" itunes:key="L2">不確かな記憶が心の隅　突くから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">朦胧的记忆刺痛了心底的角落</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ta shi ka na ki o ku ga ko ko ro no su mi tsu tsu ku ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:04.168" end="01:10.805" itunes:key="L3">I want to know if truth is painful or not<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想明白真相是不是令人惨痛的</span></p><p begin="01:11.102" end="01:16.854" itunes:key="L5">先送りした疑問は Frail<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">延后的疑问是如此的脆弱易碎</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa ki o ku ri shi ta gi mo n wa frail</span></p><p begin="01:17.284" end="01:26.734" itunes:key="L7">涙の跡が乾いていくほどに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连泪水的痕迹都已被时间风干</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na mi da no a to ga ka wa i te i ku ho do ni</span></p><p begin="01:27.436" end="01:35.455" itunes:key="L10">Trail blazed across my messy mind<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">脑海一片混乱</span></p><p begin="01:35.545" end="01:37.933" itunes:key="L12">何処へ進もうか？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今后我该何去何从？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko he su su mo u ka ？</span></p><p begin="01:38.688" end="01:42.754" itunes:key="L13">Cuz I meant to be your piece until I die<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在我死去之前都不会与你分离</span></p><p begin="01:42.859" end="01:45.349" itunes:key="L14">No one's wanna be alone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有人愿意独自一人</span></p><p begin="01:45.359" end="01:50.908" itunes:key="L16">破れて　拾い集めて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会拾集起那些破碎的点滴</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya bu re te hi ro i a tsu me te</span></p><p begin="01:51.256" end="01:55.281" itunes:key="L17">Though we fall apart between the hell's divide<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管我们被地狱的沟壑分开</span></p><p begin="01:55.291" end="02:03.998" itunes:key="L19">求められるなら　ずっと側で stay the same<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要你仍需要我 我便会永远不变地在你身边</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo to me ra re ru na ra zu 't to so ba de stay the same</span></p><p begin="02:06.333" end="02:16.744" itunes:key="L21">生まれては消えてく感覚の名前なら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">诞生又消失不见的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ma re te wa ki e te ku</span></p><p begin="02:18.897" end="02:25.532" itunes:key="L25">擦り過ぎて痛いくらい realize a lot<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">它掠过脑海 刺痛心扉 顿时感悟良多</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko su ri su gi te i ta i ku ra i realize a lot</span></p><p begin="02:25.912" end="02:31.807" itunes:key="L28">I can't igg your tender lies<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我无法承受你温柔的谎言</span></p><p begin="02:32.117" end="02:41.619" itunes:key="L31">臆病になってた　大人びるほどに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不惜伪装成小心翼翼的大人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o ku byo u ni na 't te ta o to na bi ru ho do ni</span></p><p begin="02:42.307" end="02:50.187" itunes:key="L32">Cries swallowed down but you don't mind<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">颗颗泪水往肚吞落 但你漠不关心</span></p><p begin="02:50.526" end="02:53.001" itunes:key="L34">傷つかないように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿从此能远离所有的伤痛</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki zu tsu ka na i yo u ni</span></p><p begin="02:54.322" end="03:00.179" itunes:key="L954">Don't let me be your wound<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">别让我成为你心中的伤痕</span></p><p begin="03:00.602" end="03:06.281" itunes:key="L955">Wash off all you've been bound<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将你身上的重担抛弃</span></p><p begin="03:06.836" end="03:18.491" itunes:key="L957">安息の吐息に　耳を澄ませて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">侧耳倾听那安睡的呼吸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a n so ku no to i ki ni mi mi wo su ma se te</span></p><p begin="03:18.501" end="03:22.590" itunes:key="L958">Cuz I meant to be your piece until I die<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在我死去之前都不会与你分离</span></p><p begin="03:22.600" end="03:25.099" itunes:key="L959">No one's wanna be alone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有人愿意独自一人</span></p><p begin="03:25.109" end="03:30.890" itunes:key="L1363">I'll leave my soul by your side<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会将我的灵魂留在你身边</span></p><p begin="03:30.900" end="03:37.540" itunes:key="L960">目的地もなく彷徨ってた　空の片隅<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">漫无目的 彷徨在广袤天际的一隅</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo ku te ki chi mo na ku sa ma yo 't te ta so ra no ka ta su mi</span></p><p begin="03:37.550" end="03:44.309" itunes:key="L961">照らす光は stay the same<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那道光仍旧会照耀着你 一如从前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">te ra su hi ka ri wa stay the same</span></p><p begin="03:43.793" end="03:50.033" itunes:key="L1753">Till I die<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直到我死去之前</span></p><p begin="03:50.043" end="03:56.296" itunes:key="L1858">By your side<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我都会在你身边</span></p><p begin="03:56.306" end="04:02.497" itunes:key="L1994">Till I die<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直到我死去之前</span></p><p begin="04:02.507" end="04:08.731" itunes:key="L2107">By your side<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我都会在你身边</span></p></div></body></tt>